  "title": "Instagram Expands Amazon Affiliate Integration",
  "summary": "Instagram introduces the ability for creators to add Amazon affiliate links directly to their posts and Reels, allowing them to monetize content more easily.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Instagram now lets creators add up to 30 Amazon affiliate links per Reel to make money from Amazon.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Creators previously shared Amazon links through stories, DMs, and bios, but the new integration expands this feature.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The new feature is part of Instagram's efforts to enhance user experience and integrate with shopping platforms.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
